Three offers are available:

Essential Pack:
- Complete study in PDF format;
- Sector analyses;
- Individual bank analyses;
- Benchmarks and rankings;
- License for 1 user.

Pro Pack:
- All Essential Pack features;
- Excel dataset;
- Detailed comparative tables;
- 2023–2025 historical data;
- Ratios and market shares;
- Up to 3 users from the same organization.

Corporate Executive Pack:
- All Pro Pack features;
- Executive presentation;
- Briefing session with experts;
- Custom benchmark;
- Up to 20 users from the same organization.
